      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok so so i'm looking at this lab manual and it's talking about \"transient response\" and how the current is high at first then drops to zero. can u explain why that happens during that initial phase? like why is there a surge of current before it stabilizes?",
      "source": "evaluator"
